This directory is intended for project-specific (private) libraries.

PlatformIO will compile them to static libraries and link into the executable.

The source code of each library should be placed in a separate directory,
like so:

|-- lib
|  |
|  |-- mylib
|     |-- mylib.h
|     |-- mylib.c
|     |-- library.json    (optional, describes dependencies, build flags...)

This allows PlatformIO to automatically discover and build every library.

If you need to use a library from the PlatformIO Registry, declare it in the
`lib_deps` option of platformio.ini instead of vendoring it here.

This directory is empty until the measurement, calibration and protocol code
is split out of src/main.c.